==================================================
- [ ] Critical booking/payment flows have automated coverage
- [ ] Webhook/refund logic is idempotent and recoverable
- [ ] Load test results documented with targets met or tracked
- [ ] Monitoring and alerting is active for booking/payment health
- [ ] CI quality gates protect main branch
- [ ] Runbooks and release docs are complete

